I forgot to add, due to these differences between the single and multiseason models, for now I have been unsure if one is 'better' (of course, depends on your question!) than the other, so in my reports I have been reporting both. If anyone has any thoughts on which is more appropriate for different questions/data types, I would be very grateful.

Cheers,
